obabilité de tirer une boule noire ? <br>Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply8\">Question 8:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Calculer l'expression \\(x^{2} - 1\\) pour \\(x = -3\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply9\">Question 9:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Moyenne des nombres : \\(13\\) &#59; \\(41\\) &#59; \\(7\\) et \\(39\\). Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply10\">Question 10:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(70 \\%\\) de \\(60\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply10\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply11\">Question 11:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Ecriture scientifique de \\(54 \\times 10^{22} \\)\t   <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply11\" data-label=\"\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply12\">Question 12:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(20 \\times 10 \\times 0.5 \\times 12.2=\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply12\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply13\">Question 13:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(15^{2} - 5^{2} =\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply13\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply14\">Question 14:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Le volume d'un cube est proportionnel à la longueur de son arête\t   <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply14\" data-label=\"\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply15\">Question 15:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Ecriture décimale de \\(1 - \\frac{32}{100}\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply15\" data-size=\"10\"></span> <div class=\"wims_instruction\"> Attention : saisir 1.25 pour 1,25</div></div>\t ",
